# What `gcloud builds submit` uploads from the repository root, for running
# cloudbuild.yaml by hand: the build file, the backend, and the files in the app
# its tests compare against: the generated C# contract, the map outlines, and the
# scene, whose map and pin sizes the metros are measured by.
# Triggers check out the repository themselves and ignore this file.
/*
!/cloudbuild.yaml
!/backend/
/backend/.venv/
/backend/data/
/backend/regression/
/backend/.env
**/__pycache__/
!/Assets/
/Assets/*
!/Assets/Source/
/Assets/Source/*
!/Assets/Source/Gemini/
/Assets/Source/Gemini/*
!/Assets/Source/Gemini/Tools/
/Assets/Source/Gemini/Tools/*
!/Assets/Source/Gemini/Tools/CyberContract.g.cs
!/Assets/Resources/
/Assets/Resources/*
!/Assets/Resources/Maps/
!/Assets/Scenes/
/Assets/Scenes/*
!/Assets/Scenes/Main.unity
**/.pytest_cache/
